    "Hao Wang — July 2025–August 2025. Visiting undergraduate student from Zhejiang University.": "<strong>Hao Wang</strong> — 2025年7月–2025年8月。<br>\n来自浙江大学的访问本科生。",
    "Yuanzhe Wei, an undergraduate student, coauthored a paper with Zheng Sun and Kailiang Wu in SIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis, becoming the first undergraduate coauthor in the Department of Mathematics to date. He was also the first student in the department selected for the MIT Visiting Student Program and later pursued a Ph.D. at Brown University.": "<strong>Yuanzhe Wei</strong> 在本科期间与 <strong>Zheng Sun</strong>、Kailiang Wu 合作在 SIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis 发表论文，成为数学系首位在该期刊发表成果的本科生。他也是数学系首位入选麻省理工学院（MIT）访问学生项目的学生，之后赴布朗大学攻读博士学位。",
    "Yifan Li received the MCM Outstanding Winner award, the first and only recipient in the Department of Mathematics to date.": "<strong>Yifan Li</strong> 获得美国大学生数学建模竞赛（MCM）特等奖（Outstanding Winner），是数学系首位且迄今唯一获此奖项的学生。",
